<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">AgentRouter: A Knowledge-Graph-Guided LLM Router
for 
<br class="ltx_break">Collaborative Multi-Agent Question Answering</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
