<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 8: </span>Per-question agent routing snapshots for three examples. Each case shows the question, gold answer, model prediction, and the four highest- and lowest-probability agents with their generated answers.</figcaption>
